{"unit_id": "tag:01SB:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）之间的仿射（affine）态射（morphism）。\n设<MATH_0002>。\n函子（functor）<MATH_0003>诱导一个范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATHSEG_0002>-模（modules）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0003>拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATHSEG_0004>-模（modules）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0005>\n此外，一个<MATH_0004>-模（module）作为<MATH_0005>-模（module）是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，当且仅当它作为<MATH_0006>-模（module）是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "给定态射的源与目标"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "给定态射的性质"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "两个概形之间的态射"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "诱导所述等价的函子"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "所给函子诱导的等价"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "等价左侧范畴中模的性质"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "等价左侧范畴的对象"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "等价左侧的范畴"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "ta